---
/**
 * THE WALL'S PAGE (stage 5h, on the games' shell): the shooter, before dawn, in first person. The title,
 * its three levels, what each one took kept in this browser, the thread's lines and the credits. (The
 * texts are the site's, in Spanish.)
 */
import GameFrame from '../../../components/GameFrame.astro';

const play = `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/?$/, '/')}jugar/`;
---

<GameFrame title="La muralla · Manifold Gaming" back={{ href: play, label: '← Salir de la muralla' }} hintKey="mg-wall-hint-seen">
  <span slot="hint">
    En primera persona: un clic toma el mouse y apunta. <kbd>W</kbd>
    <kbd>A</kbd>
    <kbd>S</kbd>
    <kbd>D</kbd> para moverte, <kbd>Shift</kbd> para correr, <kbd>Espacio</kbd> para saltar, <kbd>C</kbd> para agacharte detrás de algo, el clic o <kbd>X</kbd> para disparar, <kbd>R</kbd> para recargar, de <kbd>1</kbd> a <kbd>9</kbd> para elegir arma. Recorré cada nivel hasta su salida, por escaleras, ascensores y plataformas que se mueven: cada llave abre las puertas de su color. <kbd>Esc</kbd> o <kbd>P</kbd>: pausa y ajustes.
  </span>
  <script>
    import { startWall } from '@manifold/wall';
    await startWall(document.getElementById('game')!);
    window.dispatchEvent(new Event('mg-game-ready'));
    window.addEventListener('hashchange', () => location.reload());
  </script>
</GameFrame>
